# <%= current_page.data.title %>

Drink Free Days is the Better Health quit drinking app and the successor to the Stoptober app. 

The app follows the [standard pattern](documentation/guides/standard-pattern). 

---

## Architecture Overview

![Standard pattern architecture](/images/standard-pattern-architecture.png)

---

## Components

### Applications

- **Repo:** [dfd_cloudformation_iaas](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/dfd_cloudformation_iaas) – Django CMS mobile client.
- **Repo:** [drinkfree-days-nhs-login-backend](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/drinkfree-days-nhs-login-backend) – FastAPI service that handles NHS login flows and syncs data. It also caches JWT tokens tokens in Redis.

### Infrastructure as Code (IaC)

- **Repo:** [drink-free-days-iac](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/drink-free-days-iac) – Terraform code for the infrastructure.

